  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组新增了一座村民制革厂，皮革匠与牧羊人村民将在此工作。</p>\n<p>你还能找到一些与他们职业相关的隐藏战利品。</p>\n<p>这座房屋内饰细节丰富，装饰十分完整。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/419/outside-area.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/420/more-inside.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/421/inside.png\" width=\"390\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1118/422/bedroom.png\" width=\"390\"></p>\n<p>该建筑会生成在主世界的森林与平原生物群系中。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>欢迎将其加入你的整合包！</p>",
